al P}{\\partial y})\\,\\text{d}A\\\\&=\\oint_C P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSubstituting $P(x,y)=-y$ and $Q(x,y)=0,$ we get\n\n$$\\oint_C P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y=-\\oint_C y\\,\\text{d}x.$$\n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is\n\n$$r'(t)=\\langle -2\\sin t,7\\cos t\\rangle.$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our line integral as\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}-\\oint_C y\\,\\text{d}x&=-\\int_0^{2\\pi}7\\sin t\\cdot(-2\\sin t)\\,\\text{d}t\\\\&=14\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\sin^2 t\\,\\text{d}t\\\\&=14\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{1-\\cos 2t}{2}\\,\\text{d}t\\\\&=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\left(7-7\\cos 2t\\right)\\,\\text{d}t\\\\&=\\left[7t-\\frac{7}{2}\\sin 2t\\right]_0^{2\\pi}\\\\&=\\left(14 \\pi-0\\right)-\\left(0-0\\right)\\\\&=14 \\pi\\end{aligned}$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $\\text{Area}(D)=14 \\pi.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186540302 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2653811b-6a3f-50e5-80be-c5b24fcbaf1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8 \\pi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540280} {:answer/id #uuid "368712d0-119f-5f7e-9dcf-f27b8a9ce142" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "96 \\pi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540281} {:answer/id #uuid "3839d780-0e6c-5d0e-9f8e-06c50df07c5e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 \\pi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540282} {:answer/id #uuid "4456e62e-40ab-5406-bdf9-5bc6653e3f29" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 48 \\pi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540284} {:answer/id #uuid "d5a69bfa-84cf-5837-871f-0d18bdd847e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "48 \\pi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540308}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d5a69bfa-84cf-5837-871f-0d18bdd847e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "48 \\pi" :db